%description:
TR 36.814 defines an outdoor-to-indoor loss for its urban microcell scenario only. A UE with
insideBuilding = true under TR 36.814 URBAN_MACROCELL, the default of the LTE channel model, got
the path loss of an outdoor UE, without a message. The first evaluation of such a link is an
error.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.EpcSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].**.insideBuilding = true
**.channelModel[*].scenario = "URBAN_MACROCELL"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
is inside a building (insideBuilding), and TR 36.814 defines no building penetration loss for the scenario URBAN_MACROCELL
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
